{"ref":"BDB, עָטַף³","hw":"עָטַף³","html":"† III. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָטַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be feeble, faint (</strong>BA<sup>ES 27</sup> cp. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">عَطِبَ</span> <em>perish, flag</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲטֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:1\" href=\"/Psalms.102.1\">ψ 102:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲטוֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.16\">Is 57:16</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲטֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:3\" href=\"/Psalms.61.3\">ψ 61:3</a>; Pt. pass. (Ges<sup>§ 50 f</sup>) pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲטֻפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:42\" href=\"/Genesis.30.42\">Gn 30:42</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲטוּפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:19\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.19\">La 2:19</a>;—lit. <em>be feeble</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:42\" href=\"/Genesis.30.42\">Gn 30:42</a> (J; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְשׁוּרִים</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֲטוּפִים בְּרָעָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:19\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.19\">La 2:19</a>; fig. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ מִלְּפָנַי יַע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.16\">Is 57:16</a> <em>the spirit would faint before me</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲטֹף לִבִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:3\" href=\"/Psalms.61.3\">ψ 61:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:1\" href=\"/Psalms.102.1\">102:1</a> (title).<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּעָטֵף עוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.11\">La 2:11</a> <em>when infants faint</em> (for <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהֵע׳</span>; but read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲטֹף</span> <strong>Qal</strong>, so Buhl).<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהַעֲטִיף הַצֹּאן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:42\" href=\"/Genesis.30.42\">Gn 30:42</a> when the flock <em>shewed feebleness</em>.<br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְעַטֵּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:4\" href=\"/Psalms.77.4\">ψ 77:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:4\" href=\"/Psalms.143.4\">143:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְעַטָּ֑ף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:5\" href=\"/Psalms.107.5\">107:5</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְעַטֵּף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:4\" href=\"/Psalms.142.4\">142:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:8\" href=\"/Jonah.2.8\">Jon 2:8</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְעַטְּפָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:12\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.12\">La 2:12</a>;—<em>faint, faint away</em>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:12\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.12\">La 2:12</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּחָלָל</span> <em>like the wounded</em>); subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:4\" href=\"/Psalms.77.4\">ψ 77:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:4\" href=\"/Psalms.142.4\">142:4</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלַי</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַל\" href=\"/BDB,_עַל\", dir=\"rtl\">עַל</a> <strong>II 1 d</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:4\" href=\"/Psalms.143.4\">143:4</a> (+ id.); subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:8\" href=\"/Jonah.2.8\">Jon 2:8</a> (+ id.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:5\" href=\"/Psalms.107.5\">ψ 107:5</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּהֶם</span>).","next":"BDB, עָטַר","prev":"BDB, מַעֲטָפָה²"}